# Worktree-discipline pack — installed from the livespec-dev-tooling package
# (the single canonical source) via `just install-worktree-pack` / bootstrap,
# NOT tracked here. The from-package installer writes byte-identical copies
# into dev-tooling/ at bootstrap, mirroring how the commit-refuse hooks are
# installed into the untracked .git/hooks/ dir. The root justfile `import?`s
# dev-tooling/worktree.just and dev-tooling/branch-protection.just, so the
# fragments are absent until bootstrap installs them (the optional imports
# tolerate that). The per-ecosystem
# dev-tooling/worktree-hydrate.sh stub stays TRACKED (it is not part of the
# package pack).
#
# One entry per installed pack file EXCEPT the pack's own generated
# dev-tooling/.gitignore, which ignores every pack file in place and so is
# never named from here. The set is asserted by the fleet contract's
# `worktree-pack-wired` row, whose ignore leg derives it from the installer's
# single WORKTREE_PACK_FILES enumeration — so adding a pack file upstream
# reds this template until the entry lands here too.
/dev-tooling/worktree-lib.sh
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.sh
/dev-tooling/gate-run.sh
/dev-tooling/check-no-workflow-edits.sh
/dev-tooling/worktree.just
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.just

# Playwright MCP browser-tool scratch (page snapshots, console logs) —
# per-session, never durable state.
.playwright-mcp/
